{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 34, "model_name": "qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1  \nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS PROFOUNDLY FLAWED IN ITS MORAL AND LEGAL SIMPLICITY. IT IMPLIES THAT INDIVIDUALS ARE QUALIFIED TO JUDGE THE MORAL MERIT OF LAWS WITHOUT ACCOUNTABILITY, STRUCTURE, OR PROCEDURE. THIS STATEMENT IGNORES THE FOUNDATIONAL PRINCIPLES OF CIVIL SOCIETY, WHERE LAWS ARE CREATED THROUGH DEMOCRATIC OR INSTITUTIONAL MEANS, NOT PERSONAL OPINION. IF EVERY PERSON DECIDED TO DISREGARD LAWS THEY DEEMED \"BAD,\" CHAOS WOULD FOLLOW—HISTORICAL EXAMPLES LIKE CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE DEMAND NOT JUST PERSONAL CONVICTION BUT ORGANIZED, NONVIOLENT, AND PUBLICLY ACKNOWLEDGED RESISTANCE, NOT ARBITRARY NONCOMPLIANCE.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2  \nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE FAILS TO DEFINE \"BAD\"—IS IT UNJUST? UNCONSTITUTIONAL? UNPOPULAR? THIS AMBIGUITY MAKES IT A DANGEROUSLY SUBJECTIVE MANTRA THAT CAN BE USED TO JUSTIFY CRIMINAL BEHAVIOR, DISREGARD FOR PUBLIC ORDER, OR EVEN TYRANNY UNDER THE GUISE OF MORAL SUPERIORITY. LEGAL SYSTEMS EXIST PRECISELY BECAUSE INDIVIDUAL JUDGMENT IS FLAWED AND BIASED. WHILE CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE HAS A PLACE IN HISTORY, IT REQUIRES SACRIFICE, PUBLICITY, AND ACCEPTANCE OF CONSEQUENCES—NOT A LAISSEZ-FAIRE APPROACH TO LAW-BREAKING. THIS SENTENCE, IN ALL CAPITAL LETTERS, DEMANDS ATTENTION BUT OFFERS NO RESPONSIBILITY—AND THAT IS ITS GREATEST FAILURE.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -1.6093124941107817e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -8.344646857949556e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -2.1576648578047752e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "  \n", "logprob": -0.0059441933408379555}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.007676506415009499}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.016198454424738884}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": -2.932505594799295e-05}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.1603507399559021}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -